<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Energy Bolt</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Conjurer (guild level 0)
Mana: 10
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast energy bolt &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast energy bolt</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The standard spell of the conjurer, and the first one you learn: a bolt of 
magical energy flies from your hand and strikes the target. The better your 
magic and your summoning sphere, the harder it hits.
</p><p>It hits hardest against someone in clothes, and less against leather, chain 
or plate. A shield can block it. Casting it is an attack and starts a fight, 
and it can also be cast from wands.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
